# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback configuration for EventNexus
# Cloudflare Pages natively supports _redirects file
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Redirect API sitemap to static sitemap (backwards compatibility)
